<title>USA: Norwalk CSD, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Norwalk CSD, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $3.750 million of Norwalk Community Sch Dist, Iowa, generalaa obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.538 percent.</p>
